  --no-clear-cache     do not clear all caches afterwards
  --no-refresh         do not refresh the plugin and theme inventory
  --dry-run            print the resolved target and request; change nothing
  --no-wait            return the operation ID instead of waiting
  --timeout <minutes>  give up waiting after this many minutes (default 30)
  -h, --help           display help for command

Examples:
  $ kinstactl env webroot klant-x /public --env live
  $ kinstactl env webroot klant-x / --env staging --no-clear-cache
"
,
}
`;

